A structured questionnaire was developed using Google Forms to collect data from participants. The questionnaire consisted of six questions covering:

1.User role at the university
2.Frequency of visiting university service points
3.Service points where participants had experienced queues
4.Frequency of long waiting times
5.Preferred method of joining and tracking queues
6.Likelihood of using a Virtual Queue Management Mobile Application.


